# Run and verify {{name}}

A green test suite is necessary, not sufficient (PLAYBOOK Principle 4). Drive the
real flow, observe the behaviour, and quote the evidence. The verifier is never the
implementer: when the dispatch loop is in use, `ws-verifier` re-runs this in a fresh
context.

